        "text": "The team has added ten new ad spaces to the web version of the Freebuff assistant, each matching a specific space already available on the desktop app. This ensures that advertisers who buy these ads can show them in the web interface using the exact same creative sizes and design rules as the desktop version. Because the web spaces are treated as distinct targets, an ad campaign that only targets the desktop version will not automatically start appearing in the web version, keeping ad delivery precise. This is an internal update to how ad inventory is managed, so no one notices anything different in the interface unless they are buying specific ad placements.",
